  "timecoded_text_to_speech": [
    {
      "end": "00:00:20.000",
      "start": "00:00:00.000",
      "text": " So, Shivi, the stage is yours."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.000",
      "start": "00:00:20.000",
      "text": " We're in the midst of a fourth industrial revolution,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:27.000",
      "start": "00:00:23.000",
      "text": " unlike anything that's come before it, entirely unprecedented."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:31.000",
      "start": "00:00:27.000",
      "text": " I want to see technology act as a sort of invisible interface,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:37.000",
      "start": "00:00:31.000",
      "text": " between ourselves and our device, such that you actually start to forget that it's even there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:42.000",
      "start": "00:00:37.000",
      "text": " I'm going to try and paint a picture for you as some of the imaginative applications of future tech"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:47.000",
      "start": "00:00:42.000",
      "text": " that need to be on your radar now if you want to stay future-proof."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:53.000",
      "start": "00:00:47.000",
      "text": " You are the most invaluable form of intelligence in this digital arena."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:57.000",
      "start": "00:00:53.000",
      "text": " So, the future isn't just technological, it's actually human."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:04.000",
      "start": "00:00:57.000",
      "text": " I want to share with you five jobs that don't exist now that will do in the next two years."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:09.000",
      "start": "00:01:04.000",
      "text": " Rather than just tech for tech sake or technology that's just for the elite few,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:13.000",
      "start": "00:01:09.000",
      "text": " because there's no point to that, I want to democratize technology."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:16.000",
      "start": "00:01:13.000",
      "text": " I want to open this up to a wider audience."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:20.000",
      "start": "00:01:16.000",
      "text": " All I see is this real need for purpose-driven innovation."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:26.000",
      "start": "00:01:20.000",
      "text": " Stuff that, yes, impacts your bottom line, but that can actually balance profit and purpose."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:45.000",
      "start": "00:01:38.000",
      "text": " Emotionally aware forms of AI that will actually perceive and respond to our human needs."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:53.000",
      "start": "00:01:45.000",
      "text": " Mixed reality constructs that use things like VR plus AR plus one more element that I'll reveal in a second."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:58.000",
      "start": "00:01:53.000",
      "text": " Biological security. That will use something that's completely unique to us,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:03.000",
      "start": "00:01:58.000",
      "text": " our own custom unique biology for enterprise security."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:11.000",
      "start": "00:02:03.000",
      "text": " And data science, which goes well beyond traditional analytics, what are you creating that you're not tapping into within the organization?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:16.000",
      "start": "00:02:11.000",
      "text": " And in most cases, it boils down to one thing. They're not asking the right questions of the data."
