      "start": "00:02:33.000",
      "text": " You absolutely don't need to be watching from the sidelines. You can be a change driver."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:42.000",
      "start": "00:02:38.000",
      "text": " Where we talk about building the future, we talk about people, we talk about talent."
